- The protocol is fixed for as long as the session lasts. For `https`, the server and client agree
- on it during the TLS handshake, by
- [ALPN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Application-Layer_Protocol_Negotiation):
+ Протокол фиксирован на всё время сессии. Для `https` сервер и клиент договариваются о нём во время
+ рукопожатия TLS, через [ALPN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Application-Layer_Protocol_Negotiation):

= [ALPN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Application-Layer_Protocol_Negotiation):
=
